{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Brave New World"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "How Connected Are You?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to forward"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to send on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You don't need to forward this to me, I'll be going there anyway. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about cell phone use."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to interact "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "communicate and react with others"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll be taking note of how you interact."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stationary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not moving"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Stationary cameras, mounted on the wall, will be recording people talking, texting, tweeting, posting, or taking selfies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mount "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " attach to a wall"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Stationary cameras, mounted on the wall, will be recording people talking, texting, tweeting, posting, or taking selfies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dull"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not interesting or exciting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you knew how seriously dull people were today, you would get it immediately!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "verbally"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " express using oral communication"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How long will those caught immersed in their phones remain there before they raise their heads and verbally connect?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meager"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very small in amount or number"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My meager rating of 22% said I had more time for things outside of cyberspace and preferred to connect face to face."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cyberspace"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " an \u200belectronic \u200bsystem that \u200ballows \u200bcomputer users around the \u200bworld to \u200bcommunicate or \u200baccess \u200binformation "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have  more time for things outside of cyberspace and preferred to connect face to face."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le16ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.  <br/>The action will have started before that time in the future, but it will not be finished at that moment."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> describes an event which will be happening at a future point. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Tonight the Now Gallery, will be displaying art documenting \"The Death of Conversation\".</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It can also describe events which are going to happen anyway, rather than events which we choose to make happen.<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You don't need to forward this to me, I'll be going there anyway.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " It can also be used to refer to fixed arrangements and plans. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Stationary cameras will be recording people talking, texting, tweeting, posting, or taking selfies. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll be the one standing in a corner watching the rest of you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "While you're looking at the art - that is if you really are looking at the art - I'll be taking note of how you interact."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This in turn will be feeding into large viewing screens at either end of the gallery."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Unreal Conditional: Expressing Imaginary Future Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Unreal Conditional to express imaginary or future situations. <br/>You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">If \u2026 were</span> + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + <span class=\"italic\">infinitive</span> to express a hypothetical future situation that is unlikely to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The Present Unreal Conditional is also called the Second Conditional.<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the structure:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\">If\u2026 </span>Simple Past<span class=\"italic\">, \u2026 would</span> + <span class=\"italic\">verb</span> or <br/><span class=\"italic\">Would + verb \u2026 if \u2026 </span>Simple Past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If you understood the difference between these two pictures, would you be able to explain it to me?</span> <br/>It is unclear whether I know the difference between the two pictures, so the outcome is impossible to predict."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">If \u2026 were</span> + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + <span class=\"italic\">infinitive</span> to talk about imaginary future situations, especially when it is not likely the situation will happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">If you were to stand in a crowded area and watch the people, what would you see?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you were to stand close to people, what would you hear?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you were to compare a picture of people on the street today with those taken 25 years ago, what would you notice?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you knew how seriously dull people were today, you would understand my point immediately! "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "As you go through your week, observe people and their cellphones, especially in groups."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write short notes describing what you see and whether the people are interacting with each other. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do this 3 or 4 times. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use your notes to talk about the way people interact in groups. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add what you think will be happening in the future point."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about imaginary future situations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your descriptions to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write short notes describing people in groups."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use my notes to say what is happening and how they are interacting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my description with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le16ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "If you were to stand in a crowded area and watch the people, what would you see? If you were to stand close to people, what would you hear? If you were to compare a picture of people on the street today with those taken 25 years ago, what would you notice? If you understood the difference could you explain how it happened?\n<br>\nTonight the Now Gallery will be displaying art documenting \"The Death of Conversation\". You don't need to forward this to me, I'll be going there anyway. I'll be the one standing in a corner watching the rest of you. While you're looking at the art - that is, if you really are looking at the art - I'll be taking note of how you interact.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Stationary cameras, mounted on the wall, will be recording people talking, texting, tweeting, posting, or taking selfies. This in turn will be feeding into large viewing screens at either end of the gallery.\n<br>\nWhat is the exhibit about? If you knew how seriously dull people were today, you would get it immediately! How sad we are! The images captured show how we look to devices, rather than to the people we are with. How long will those caught immersed in their phones remain there before they raise their heads and verbally connect?", "id": 2, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn10le16ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "If you were at this exhibit but didn't remember it until you revisited your social media, then perhaps you, like the people on the walls are overconnected.\n<br>\nI took an online test to see where I stood compared to others in regards to being connected to the net. My meager rating of 22% said I had more time for things outside of cyberspace and preferred to connect face to face. Where do you stand?", "id": 3, "time": "84000", "image": "engenn10le16ob02re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about technology and personal dilemmas."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can express events that will be happening at a future point. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about imaginary future situations. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How do you feel when people use cell phones when they are out with you?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How often do you tune out of a conversation and tune into information on your phone when you are out?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " My cell phone is my life!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions"